      "en": "Professional studio filming, multi-configuration installation tutorials, and lifestyle scene video assets for LIVTAB Creator modular standing desk.",
      "zh-CN": "LIVTAB Creator 模块化升降桌专业线下影棚拍摄、全桌型安装教程与实景场景视频矩阵。",
      "zh-TW": "LIVTAB Creator 模組化升降桌專業線下影棚拍攝、全桌型安裝教程與實景場景視頻矩陣。"
